<title>UK: CIC sets $400 million one-year FRN.</title>
<headline>CIC sets $400 million one-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT INDUSTRIAL ET COMMERCIAL</p>
<p> AMT    $400 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    05.AUG.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    05.AUG.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A3	  ISS PRICE  100.02    FULL FEES   5 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    100.02</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    2.5 BP    SELL CONC  2.5 BP    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
